# The suite runs the client against the DALICC application in the same process and
# uses that repository's fixtures (see tests/conftest.py), so it cannot run from
# an unpacked distribution. It stays in the repository rather than in the sdist.
prune tests

# The changelog of the package, which the sdist should carry beside the licence, the
# NOTICE and the README. A wheel has nowhere to put it: the only project-root files a
# wheel carries are the ones named in `license-files`, and a changelog is not one.
include CHANGELOG.md
